  "title": "10-Minute Mushroom Carbonara",
  "description": "This creamy carbonara recipe combines garlic, fresh mushrooms, eggs, and Parmesan cheese to create a rich sauce for spaghetti in a matter of minutes!",
  "authors": [
    "Ryan Schroeder"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-07-23T19:51:53-04:00",
